    <briefdescription>
<para>Performance tests for AQL Consolidation Phase 2: Validation SLA verification (≤ 500ms per parse). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tests verify that the parser validation pipeline meets defined SLA:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Parser call duration: ≤ 500ms</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Validation throughput: ≥ 100 queries/second</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Error enrichment overhead: ≤ 50ms</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>See: src/query/AQL_LLM_INTEGRATION_CONTRACT.md §4.3 (SLA &amp; Guarantees) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
